@startuml
title Mount Action Sequence

actor User
participant CLI
participant Pyroform
participant PyroformEngine
participant PyroParser
participant SketchGenerator
participant PyroflowEngine

User -> CLI: mount -i config.yaml
CLI -> Pyroform: mount(input_path)
Pyroform -> PyroformEngine: mount(input_path)
PyroformEngine -> PyroParser: parse(input_path)
PyroParser --> PyroformEngine: List[PyroConfig]

loop for each config
  PyroformEngine -> SketchGenerator: generate_mount_sketch(config)
  SketchGenerator -> CommandGenerator: generate_mountpoint_command()
  SketchGenerator -> CommandGenerator: generate_mount_command()
  SketchGenerator --> PyroformEngine: mount_sketch
  PyroformEngine -> PyroflowEngine: execute_sketch(mount_sketch)
  PyroflowEngine --> PyroformEngine: mount_result
end

PyroformEngine --> Pyroform: MountResult
Pyroform --> CLI: Result
CLI --> User: Success/Failure
@enduml
